sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application Pods
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry Collector<br/>8889/TCP HTTPS
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>(MonitoringStack)<br/>9090/TCP HTTPS
    participant Thanos as ThanosQuerier<br/>9090/TCP HTTPS
    participant NSProxy as Namespace Proxy<br/>(kube-rbac-proxy +<br/>prom-label-proxy)<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant User as User / Dashboard
    participant Tempo as Tempo<br/>4317/TCP gRPC
    participant KubeAPI as kube-apiserver<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Admission Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over App,Prom: Flow 1: Metrics Collection Pipeline

    App->>OTel: Metrics scrape<br/>HTTPS/8889, TLS (service-CA)
    OTel->>Prom: Remote write<br/>HTTPS/9090, TLS (service-CA)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    Prom->>Thanos: Query federation<br/>HTTPS/9090, mTLS
    User->>Route: GET metrics<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS (reencrypt)<br/>Auth: OAuth / Bearer
    Route->>NSProxy: Forward request<br/>HTTPS/8443, TLS (service-CA)<br/>Auth: kube-rbac-proxy SAR
    NSProxy->>NSProxy: prom-label-proxy injects<br/>namespace label (tenant isolation)
    NSProxy->>Prom: Query with namespace filter<br/>HTTPS/9090, TLS (service-CA)
    Prom-->>NSProxy: Scoped metrics response
    NSProxy-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>User: JSON metrics

    Note over App,Tempo: Flow 2: Distributed Tracing Pipeline

    App->>OTel: OTLP traces<br/>gRPC/4317, TLS (optional)
    OTel->>Tempo: Export traces<br/>gRPC/4317, TLS (optional)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount

    Note over KubeAPI,Webhook: Flow 3: Webhook Label Injection

    KubeAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-prometheus-monitors<br/>HTTPS/9443, TLS (cert-manager)<br/>Auth: Kubernetes admission
    Webhook->>KubeAPI: Namespace lookup<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    Webhook->>KubeAPI: Monitoring CR lookup<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    Webhook-->>KubeAPI: Mutated response<br/>(inject monitoring label)
